    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"a quiet, immediate escape\"... that sounds almost peaceful. like just letting the noise stop. but i always feel like i should keep trying, keep fighting to belong. is it wrong to just want to stop fighting? to just... let go of the struggle altogether?",
